stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> QUEUED : admission
  QUEUED --> RUNNING : claim, attempt 1
  QUEUED --> FAILED : never dispatched
  RUNNING --> RETRYING : lease expired
  RETRYING --> RUNNING : claim, attempt n+1
  RETRYING --> FAILED : attempts or deadline exhausted
  RUNNING --> COMPLETED : all slots saved
  RUNNING --> PARTIALLY_COMPLETED : some slots failed
  RUNNING --> NEEDS_CLARIFICATION : plan cannot proceed
  RUNNING --> FAILED : permanent error
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  PARTIALLY_COMPLETED --> [*]
  NEEDS_CLARIFICATION --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
